<view class="v12-page generating-page" wx:if="{{accessReady}}">
  <v12-navbar title="{{stage === 'plane' ? '平面方案生成' : '立面方案生成'}}" show-back show-brand="{{false}}" />
  <view class="v12-card generate-card">
    <text class="generate-title">{{statusText}}</text>
    <text class="generating-copy">任务 {{jobId}} · 请求 {{count}} 个{{stage === 'plane' ? '平面' : '立面'}}方案</text>
    <text class="percent">{{progress}}%</text>
    <view class="progress"><i style="width: {{progress}}%;"></i></view>
    <text class="generating-copy">审核通过 {{acceptedCount}} 个。候选将在任务结算后开放查看。</text>
    <text wx:if="{{pollError}}" class="generating-copy">{{pollError}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="stage-tip"><t-icon name="info-circle" size="28px" color="#c78217" /><view><text>进度以任务服务返回为准</text><text>生成失败或数量不足时，按有效方案数量结算，退款可在点数记录查看。</text></view></view>
  <view class="generate-actions"><view class="v12-primary-button" bindtap="continueLater">后台继续</view><view wx:if="{{canCancel}}" class="v12-secondary-button" bindtap="cancel">{{cancelling ? '取消处理中' : '取消生成'}}</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{finished}}" class="preview-link" bindtap="previewResult">查看已生成方案</view>
</view>
